      <div class="policy"><b><svg><use href="#i-sun"/></svg>If there's swell</b><span>We don't just cancel your day. When the sea is up, boats go out with one of our captains at the helm, so you still get your trip.</span><b><svg><use href="#i-calendar"/></svg>Changes and cancellations</b><span>Email or call us as early as you can. Full terms are in our <a class="link" style="min-height:0;display:inline" href="#policy" data-open="policy">refunds and cancellations policy</a>.</span></div>
